# Docker build context exclusion for builds that use the repository root as
# context (the ROS stack image, the ros-monitor image and the video grid
# dashboard). Keeps the context small and avoids shipping build artifacts,
# secrets, or the Android and documentation trees into the images.
.git
.github
node_modules
**/build
**/outputs
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.venv
**/*.egg-info/
*.apk
*.ndjson
local.properties
google-services.json
INTERNAL.md
private-notes
LyrebirdApp
src
docs
public
astro.config.mjs
package.json
package-lock.json
tsconfig.json
GroundStation/video_test/logs
GroundStation/tests
GroundStation/Python/test_scripts
# The whole GroundStation/ROS tree stays in context: the stack image builds every
# package in it, and the ros-monitor image copies explicit paths, so the extra
# ~140 KB costs that image nothing.
GroundStation/video_test/compose.yaml
scripts/verify-integration.sh
README.md
LICENSE
